{"ID":"20240206095019-87mihpd","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206095019-87mihpd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095019-87mihpd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095028-c0639ft\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095023-x1jwvu8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095028-c0639ft\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:158,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:158\u0026#125;","title":"大腹皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240830163646"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095028-c0639ft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095028-c0639ft","updated":"20240206095032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于云南、福建、台湾、海南等地。\n【性状】\t略呈椭圆形或长卵形瓢状，长47cm，宽23.5cm，厚0.2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0.5cm。 外果皮深棕色至近黑色，具不规则的纵皱纹及隆起的横纹，顶端有花柱残痕，基部有果梗及残存萼片。内果皮凹陷，褐色或深棕色、光滑呈硬壳状。体轻，质硬，纵向撕裂后可见中果皮纤维。气微，味微涩。\n【性味】\t辛，微温。\n【功效】\t下气宽中，行水消肿之功效。现代研究，该品有兴奋胃肠道平滑肌、促胃肠动力作用，并有促进纤维蛋白溶解等作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095023-x1jwvu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095023-x1jwvu8","updated":"20240206095023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095023-o95uel8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711130523-q5yaedk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711130523-q5yaedk","updated":"20240711132446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 13-20240711132347-8653sy6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 640px;\" parent-style=\"width: 650px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 325px;","style":"width: 315px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 14-20240711132446-udkxzf5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 315px;\" parent-style=\"width: 325px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711130551-kaox7wx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711130551-kaox7wx","updated":"20240711131317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 584px;","style":"width: 574px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 2-20240711130548-xweik4c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 574px;\" parent-style=\"width: 584px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 609px;","style":"width: 599px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 4-20240711131317-y1u0uob.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 599px;\" parent-style=\"width: 609px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711132519-d8etn3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711132519-d8etn3u","updated":"20240711132556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 632px;","style":"width: 622px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240619190040-7xj84qo.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 622px;\" parent-style=\"width: 632px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 603px;","style":"width: 593px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (16)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 16-20240711132556-tu9g9ux.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 593px;\" parent-style=\"width: 603px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711131942-yavj8l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711131942-yavj8l0","updated":"20240711132221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 8-20240711131942-g0tdi0b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 799px;","style":"width: 789px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 12-20240711132221-2085ird.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 789px;\" parent-style=\"width: 799px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711132216-bvmja3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711132216-bvmja3y","updated":"20240711132241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 648px;","style":"width: 638px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 9-20240711132040-9w1x9rj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 638px;\" parent-style=\"width: 648px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 312px;","style":"width: 302px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 10-20240711132105-9md8m8k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 302px;\" parent-style=\"width: 312px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 293px;","style":"width: 283px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 11-20240711132140-knwnpp5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 283px;\" parent-style=\"width: 293px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240711131650-1js6oyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711131650-1js6oyv","updated":"20240711131847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 843px;","style":"width: 833px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 6-20240711131650-zkirl1y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 833px;\" parent-style=\"width: 843px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 7-20240711131847-6iyirkb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711131253-w9u7kz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711131253-w9u7kz4","updated":"20240711131605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 3-20240711131253-cj0i32h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 572px;","style":"width: 562px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槟榔 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槟榔 5-20240711131605-k7r5aja.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 562px;\" parent-style=\"width: 572px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711130302-7esfcvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711130302-7esfcvr","updated":"20240711130914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为棕榈科植物槟榔的干燥果皮。（槟榔果的种子入药叫做槟榔；而槟榔的果皮入药叫做大腹皮，大腹皮一般是未成熟的果实的果皮，成熟的果实的果皮叫大腹毛）"}]},{"ID":"20240711131046-qqhk2gp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711131046-qqhk2gp","updated":"20240711131200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：从中药定以上来说，槟榔果里面的种子才是槟榔，平时人们熟知所吃的槟榔实际上是大腹皮；"}]},{"ID":"20240711130302-cu4vhsi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240711130302-cu4vhsi"}},{"ID":"20240830163640-6iq01a8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-6iq01a8","updated":"20240830163646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：大腹皮"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-t2vtjgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-t2vtjgl","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大腹皮《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-7g78gqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-7g78gqk","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàFùPí"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-ihxogcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-ihxogcs","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】PERICARPIUMARECAE"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-tdujsne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-tdujsne","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为棕榈科植物槟榔ArecacatechuL.的干燥果皮。冬季至次春采收未成熟的果实，煮后干燥，纵剖两瓣，剥取果皮，习称“大腹皮”；春末至秋初采收成熟果实，煮后干燥，剥取果皮，打松，晒干，习称“大腹毛”。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-hzes1ba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-hzes1ba","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-itrwi9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-itrwi9k","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大腹皮：略呈椭圆形或长卵形瓢状，长4～7cm，宽2～3.5cm，厚0.2～0.5cm。外果皮深棕色至近黑色，具不规则的纵皱纹及隆起的横纹，顶端有花柱残痕，基部有果梗及残存萼片。内果皮凹陷，褐色或深棕色、光滑呈硬壳状。体轻，质硬，纵向撕裂后可见中果皮纤维。气微，味微涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-60xrzhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-60xrzhp","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大腹毛：略呈椭圆形或瓢状。外果皮多已脱落或残存。中果皮棕毛状，黄白色或淡棕色，疏松质柔。内果皮硬壳状，黄棕色至棕色，内表面光滑，有时纵向破裂。无臭，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-zczw9qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-zczw9qt","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】本品粉末黄白色或黄棕色。中果皮纤维成束，细长，直径8～15μm，微木化，纹孔明显，周围细胞中含有圆簇状硅质块，直径约8μm。内果皮细胞呈不规则多角形、类圆形或椭圆形，直径48～88μm,纹孔明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-2fvutmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-2fvutmd","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-88sjjuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-88sjjuv","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大腹皮：除去杂质，洗净，切段，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-jmh7tls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-jmh7tls","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大腹毛：除去杂质，洗净，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-kuvasn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-kuvasn1","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-qw58re4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-qw58re4","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归脾、胃、大肠、小肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-0cw6ynh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-0cw6ynh","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】下气宽中，行水消肿。用于湿阻气滞，脘腹胀闷，大便不爽，水肿胀满，脚气浮肿，小便不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-p0kkogw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-p0kkogw","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】4.5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-ypfh8wx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-ypfh8wx","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-c3ofe6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-c3ofe6h","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-jwcohi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-jwcohi5","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大腹皮《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-jvg7esj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-jvg7esj","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】侯宁极《药谱》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-k6vqxua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-k6vqxua","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàFùPí"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-ac786em","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-ac786em","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】槟榔皮（孙思邈），大腹毛（《医林纂要》），茯毛（《会约医镜》），槟榔衣（《药材资料汇编》），大腹绒（《药材学》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-k4xtd22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-k4xtd22","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为棕榈科植物槟榔的果皮。冬、春二季采收成热果实，剥下果皮，打松，置水中浸泡，晒干，再打松除去外果皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-mh8qni5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-mh8qni5","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】主产广东海南岛、云南、台湾；广西、福建亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-dc6z1uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-dc6z1uh","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥果皮，通常纵剖为二。未打松者呈椭圆形瓢状。长6～7厘米，宽约3厘米，厚约1厘米；外果皮灰棕黄色，有褐色斑点及纵裂纹。已打松者，外果皮脱落，中果皮为黄白色至灰黄色的纤维，纤维纵向排列，外层松散成缕，内层纤维较粗，现棕毛状。内壁凹陷，褐色或深棕色。表面光滑呈硬壳状。体轻松，质柔韧，易纵向撕裂。无臭，味淡。以色黄白、质柔韧、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-31ycwzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-31ycwzp","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣净杂质，碾轧使软，敲打，筛去泥屑。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-5fpmfmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-5fpmfmi","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-5cmzymd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-5cmzymd","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-0dlrtx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-0dlrtx0","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《开宝本草》：\"微温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-ktra189","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-ktra189","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"辛，微温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-w49wa9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-w49wa9i","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-ar2oly5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-ar2oly5","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入脾、胃、大小肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-oaj1rgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-oaj1rgq","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺；脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-4bkpyta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-4bkpyta","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药品化义》：\"入脾、肺、胃、大小肠五经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-1jd6bbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-1jd6bbx","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-2ffp7mj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-2ffp7mj","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下气宽中，行水。治脘腹痞胀，脚气，水肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-ddd7f36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-ddd7f36","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《日华子本草》：\"下一切气，止霍乱，通大小肠，健脾开胃，调中。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-3up3xuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-3up3xuf","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《开宝本草》：\"主冷热气攻心腹，大肠壅毒，痰膈，醋心。并以姜盐同煎，入疏气药良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-y0btgyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-y0btgyv","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"降逆气，消肌肤中水气浮肿，脚气壅逆，瘴疟痞满，胎气恶阻胀闷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-umpphl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-umpphl6","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草再新》：\"泻肺，和胃气，利湿追风，宽肠消肿，理腰脚气，治疟疾泻痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-cr59zkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-cr59zkh","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，2～3钱；或入丸剂。外用：煎水洗或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-yu863tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-yu863tg","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】气虚体弱者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-l8fkrkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-l8fkrkm","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-06ads24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-06ads24","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治脚气，肿满腹胀，大小便秘涩：大腹皮一两（锉），槟榔一两，木香半两，木通二两（锉），郁李仁一两（汤浸去皮，微炒），桑根白皮二两（锉），牵牛子二两（微炒）。上药捣筛为散。每服四钱，以水一中盏，入生姜半分，葱白二七寸，煎至六分，去滓。不计时候，温服，以利为度。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-am6mati","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-am6mati","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治男子妇人脾气停滞，风湿客搏，脾经受湿，气不流行，致头面虚浮，四肢肿满，心腹膨胀，上气喘急，腹胁如鼓，绕脐胀闷，有妨饮食，上攻下疰，来去不定，举动喘乏：五茄皮、地骨皮、生姜皮、大腹皮、茯苓皮各等分。上为粗末。每眼三钱，水一盏半，煎至八分，去滓，稍热服之，不拘时候。切忌生冷油腻坚硬等物。（《局方》五皮散）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-ym2d1tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-ym2d1tw","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治漏疮恶秽：大腹皮煎汤洗之。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-h5m31a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-h5m31a3","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-dko66hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-dko66hq","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大腹皮《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-lxfpqsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-lxfpqsx","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】侯宁极《药谱》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-iwwv7w2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-iwwv7w2","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàFùPí"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-mvprtja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-mvprtja","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】ArecePeel,BetelnutPeel"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-kowuq3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-kowuq3u","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】槟榔皮、槟榔壳大腹毛、茯毛、槟榔衣、大腹绒"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-bwiuec8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-bwiuec8","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-80fo5eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-80fo5eh","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为棕榈科植物槟榔的果皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-5tyntr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-5tyntr0","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：ArecacatechuL."}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-jqh4jtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-jqh4jtc","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：冬、春二季采收成熟果实，剥下果皮，打松，乙水中浸泡，晒干，再打松除去外果皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-rd5hd4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-rd5hd4d","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】槟榔，乔木，高10-18m；不分枝，叶脱落后形成明显的环纹。羽状复叶，丛生于茎顶端，长1.3-2m，光滑，叶轴三棱形；小叶片披针状线或线形，长30-70cm，宽2.5-6cm，基部较狭，顶端小叶愈合，有不规则分裂。花序着生于最下一叶的基部，有佛焰苞状大苞片，长倒卵形，长达40cm，光滑，花序多分枝；花单性同株；雄花小，多数，无柄，紧贴分枝上部，通常单生，很少对生，萼片3，厚而细小，花瓣3，卵状长圆形，长5-6mm，雄蕊6，花丝短小，退化雌蕊3，丝状；雌花较大而少，无梗，着生于花序轴或分枝基部，萼片3，长圆状卵形，长12-15mm。坚果卵圆形或长圆形，长5-6cm，花萼和花瓣宿存，熟时红色。每年开花2次，花期3-8月，冬花不结果；果期12月至翌年6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-b0c7628","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-b0c7628","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-h6ouhtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-h6ouhtv","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：我国福建、台湾、广东、海南、广西、云南等地有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-wb65zg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-wb65zg4","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：原产马来西亚。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-t5bet7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-t5bet7c","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】气候土壤：喜生长于高温地区，以土层浓厚而湿润的砂质壤土或粘质壤土为佳。整地：选择有树荫处设苗床，松土后，按行，株距各30cm开穴，在定植前4-6个月先将空开好，使用权穴内土壤风化，穴深60-80cm，行距2、5-3、5cm。种植：育苗：在荫蔽的山地，掘一深达30cm的长坑，放一层果实，覆盖一层砂土。层层堆放，浇水湿润。经过20日后，即可抽出米粒大小的芽，限出栽种于苗床，每穴一个，覆土浇水。定苗：于7或者10月为宜，植前施基肥，选茎粗而有2-3个节的幼苗栽培。覆土至穴面15cm浇水湿润，并盖草以减少水分的蒸发。田间管理：栽后2-3后内均须荫蔽。3年后在离根15cm周围掘一环浅沟，追肥一次，结果后须每年追肥一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-h1vconb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-h1vconb","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-e39vs22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-e39vs22","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥果皮，通常纵剖为二。未打松者呈椭圆形瓢状，长5-7cm，宽约3cm，厚约1cm；外果皮灰棕黄色，有褐色斑点及纵裂纹。已打松者，外果皮脱落，中果皮为黄白色至灰黄色的纤维，纤维纵向排列，外层松散成缕，内层纤维较粗，现棕毛状。内壁凹陷，褐色或深棕色，表面光滑呈硬壳状。体轻松，质柔韧，易纵向撕裂。无臭，味淡。以色黄白、质柔韧、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-ogwneh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-ogwneh2","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴定：粉末：灰黄色。外果皮细胞表面观多角形或长多角形，直径9-15?m，长至52.8?m，壁略呈连珠状增厚。中果皮纤维多成束，细长条形，平直或稍弯曲，有的一边呈小波状凸起，末端稍钝圆，直径约10?m，壁厚，木化，孔沟明显；纤维束周围细胞含硅质块，硅质块直径6-9?m，含硅质块细胞壁厚，木化。中果皮石细胞类圆形、类长方形、长椭圆形，直径22-50?m，壁稍厚，木化或微木化，纹孔、孔沟明显，有的层纹较清楚。内果皮细胞类多角形、类圆形、长多角形，直径9-24?m，壁厚，木化，孔沟较明显。本品以色黄白、质柔韧、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-znp2160","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-znp2160","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】少量槟榔碱含儿茶素。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-29e4706","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-29e4706","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】对肠平滑肌的作用大腹皮煎剂能使兔离体肠管紧张性升高，收缩幅度减少，其作用可被阿托品所拮抗。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-vgabvq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-vgabvq9","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣净杂质，碾轧使软，敲打，筛去泥屑。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-or6tprp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-or6tprp","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；性微温"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-swmbxlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-swmbxlh","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】脾；胃；大肠；小肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-qddinop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-qddinop","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】下气宽中；行水消肿。主胸腹胀闷；水肿；脚气；小便不利"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-pgzzpy1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-pgzzpy1","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，5-10g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，煎水洗；或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-swguip2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-swguip2","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】气虚体弱者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-p7yhm7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-p7yhm7l","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】大腹皮散《太平圣惠方》：小儿腹内痞结；二便不利。大腹子散：《赤水玄珠》：风毒脚气。癫狂梦醒汤《医林改错》：癫狂；疏凿饮子《世医得效方》：大小便不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-vz0zxze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-vz0zxze","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-pib09st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-pib09st","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《药性类明》：大腹皮，丹溪常用之以治肺气喘促，及水肿药中又多用之，盖亦取其泄肺，以杀水之源也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-6wyqaj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-6wyqaj5","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：大腹皮，即槟榔皮也。其气味所主，与槟榔大略相同，第槟榔性烈，破气最捷，腹皮性缓，下气稍迟。入阳明、太阴经，二经虚则寒热不调，逆气攻走，或痰滞中焦，结成膈证；或湿热郁积，酸味醋心；辛温暖胃豁痰，通行下气，则诸证除矣。大肠壅毒，以其辛散破气而走阳明，故亦主之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-n9atks4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-n9atks4","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草汇言》：大腹皮，宽中利气之捷药也。方龙谭曰，主一切冷热之气上攻心腹，消上下水肿之气四体虚浮，下大肠壅滞之气二便不利，开关格痰饮之气阻塞不通，能疏通下泄，为畅达脏腑之剂。按宋人又有安胎之说，然此药既为利气之药，又何以安其胎乎？如有余之气胜而胎不安者，使之气下，则胎自安矣。又谓此药有健胃之理，夫既为下气之药，又何以益其胃乎？如有余之气壅塞不通，使之气下，则中气自宽，食饮可进矣。若损气，为大腹皮之常性也，元虚气少者，概勿施用。朱正泉曰，大腹皮，《斗门方》配六君子汤，治中气虚滞而或腹胀者，服之即通，则安胎健胃之理，不外是矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-gcy989k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-gcy989k","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草述》：治虚肿者，用大补气之味，而少入腹皮。又见有治痰火者，常以此味少少入健脾之剂，或皆取其能导壅顺气而不甚酷烈乎？用者审之。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-uenh1wx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-uenh1wx","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经逢原》：槟榔性沉重，泄有形之积滞；腹皮性轻浮，散无形之滞气。故痞满膨胀，水气浮肿，脚气壅逆者宜之。惟虚胀禁用，以其能泄真气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-3hll2ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-3hll2ss","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.其他《日华子本草》：下一切气，止霍乱，通大小肠，健脾开胃，调中。《开宝本草》：主冷热气攻心腹，大肠壅毒，痰膈，醋心。并以姜盐同煎，入疏气药良。《纲目》：降逆气，消肌肤中水气浮肿，脚气壅逆，瘴疟痞满，胎气恶阻胀闷。《本草再新》：泻肺，和胃气，利湿追风，宽肠消肿，理腰脚气，治疟疾泻痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163640-fqqqsii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163640-fqqqsii","updated":"20240830163700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163630-57wd14t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830163630-57wd14t","updated":"20240830163700"}},{"ID":"20240830163631-1s36nrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163631-1s36nrt","updated":"20240830163700"}}]}